These three runs show very high variability across syntheses — modulus ranges 197–438 bar, pore fraction 0.394–0.505. This is not reproducible; the apparent high modulus in run 1 is not confirmed.

**The 17-0add-15deg-30s-N2-1200s condition** (mixing_temp=25, bath_temp=15, pullcast_speed=15, N2=True, wait=30s, nips=1200s, polymer_wt=17.0) has been run 7 times:
