**The condition `17-0add-5deg-90s-N2-1800s` (mixing_temp=25, bath_temp=5, pullcast_speed=18, nitrogen=True, coupon_to_bath_wait_time=90, nips_bath_wait_time=1800, polymer_wt=17.0)** stands out:
